                                "sense_id": "d2642e5f-4fcd-3c5d-93ea-65fac5ecfbf8",
                                "text": "The Greek word, which was chosen to express this mysterious resemblance, bears so close an affinity to the orthodox symbol, that the profane of every age have derided the furious contests which the difference of a single diphthong excited between the Homoousians and the Homoiousians."
                            }
                        ]
